**7.1. CRAFT Text Detector**
* **Bundled under:** `craft_runtime/`
* **Original project:** CRAFT: Character-Region Awareness for Text Detection
* **Authors:** Youngmin Baek, Bado Lee, Dongyoon Han, Sangdoo Yun, Hwalsuk Lee
* **Organization:** Clova AI Research, NAVER Corp.
* **Official repository:** [https://github.com/clovaai/CRAFT-pytorch](https://github.com/clovaai/CRAFT-pytorch)
* **Original Paper:** [CVPR 2019 Publication](https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_CVPR_2019/papers/Baek_Character_Region_Awareness_for_Text_Detection_CVPR_2019_paper.pdf)
* **License:** MIT License (See `craft_runtime/LICENSE` for the full MIT license text).

**Recommended Academic Citation for CRAFT:**
If reproducing or referencing the text-detection layer of this framework academically, please cite the original CRAFT authors:
```bibtex
